      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Parents and children assemble in the kindergarten hall for the climax of the crafts contest. The kindergarten director and the lead teacher take the stage to praise all the young participants before announcing who took the top prize. Listen to the Russian announcement first, and do not worry about catching every single word.",
